            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Th\xF4ng tin ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\xECnh v\xE0 chi ph\xED r\xF5 r\xE0ng.</span></li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Theo s\xE1t t\u1EEB l\xFAc t\xECm hi\u1EC3u \u0111\u1EBFn khi chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB xu\u1EA5t c\u1EA3nh.</span></li>
