      <span><i class="fas fa-circle"></i>{{ orderListUpdatedLabel }}</span>
      <small>Th\xF4ng tin c\xF3 th\u1EC3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i theo th\u1EDDi \u0111i\u1EC3m tuy\u1EC3n v\xE0 k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 ki\u1EC3m tra h\u1ED3 s\u01A1.</small>
